  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 102.61 Dredging activity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 102.61 “Dredging activity” means any activity that removes or ruts any organic or inorganic substance from or in any jurisdictional area, regardless of whether the material is of natural or human origins.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945, (formerly Env-Wt 102.62)",
